{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0483_1000_p", "source_sha256": "bea7a45403adbb154edd2936067704aa7e14c3bf42a30a956daa05db726f7dae", "ja": "（たまたま立ち寄った本屋に、可憐がいた。\n何か、悩んでいるみたいだけど……）", "zh": "（碰巧路过的书店里，遇到了可怜。\n她好像有什么烦恼……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0483_1001_045kar", "source_sha256": "0b3a23426848ff5ffb5b4ddd68f5daf95406fcfafe8bc678cec1d06905676e3d", "ja": "うう……ど、どうしよう……。\nこ、この本で、いいんだよね……？", "zh": "呜呜……怎、怎么办才好……。\n这、这本书，没问题吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0483_1002_045kar", "source_sha256": "12dfd2a7f601be61906498b7712b4a4a4b4ffb418804e02e2248159f62664b84", "ja": "絵も綺麗だし、面白そうだけど……主人公の名前が、\n『可憐』って……き、気にしすぎかなぁ……？", "zh": "画也很漂亮，看起来也很有趣……可是，主角的名字居然是『可怜』……是、是不是我太在意了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0483_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "dbbf567ab1a961d06a3a63f1e3ff06cfe585d72fb39ffbbe00758875e73060af", "ja": "で、でも、せっかく薦めてくれたんだし……。\nあ……そ、そうだ。他の本と一緒に買えば……！", "zh": "但、但是，难得你特意推荐给我……  \n啊……对、对了！和其他书一起买的话……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0483_1004_p", "source_sha256": "bc01a3dc1b19f24ffb896ae63ef86c4be21526bfe2c8d769ce5a4de2a8bfff76", "ja": "お疲れさま、可憐。\nさっきから何を悩んでるんだ？", "zh": "辛苦了，可怜。\n你从刚才起就在烦恼什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0483_1005_045kar", "source_sha256": "917f7f61e355db71bab2ecffbe3483fbdb4987be3773f30d45b416416ad31ef6", "ja": "え……？　ひ、ひゃあ！？\n{$P$}さん……！", "zh": "诶……？　呀、呀啊！？\n{$P$}先生……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0483_1006_p", "source_sha256": "204b27f558c22c563d6aae22a432263fdc4d88d70f70aba6a2fafe9f3176685a", "ja": "あ、ごめん。\n驚かせるつもりはなかったんだけど……。", "zh": "啊，抱歉。\n我没打算吓到你的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0483_1007_045kar", "source_sha256": "1be52802c8701674d94e1ab138dc3deb8b01738cc2294f3adafa8e95bc3bf0ad", "ja": "ど、どうして、{$P$}さんが\nここに……。", "zh": "为、为什么……{$P$}先生会在这里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0483_1008_p", "source_sha256": "fd8093aac15c50ac524f391e29a761c6b0eaf0300e84df49864e6d95b81ffd99", "ja": "たまたま立ち寄っただけだけど……\nそれより、何か悩んでるのか？", "zh": "只是碰巧路过这里……\n话说回来，你是不是有什么烦恼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0483_1009_045kar", "source_sha256": "6d2d7827929e99e6b4e8ec7e42844152dfdf06a9acfb379bf8854bf7dd067169", "ja": "あのっ、だ、大丈夫です……。大丈夫ですから、\nその……き、気にしないでください……！", "zh": "那个，没、没关系……真的没关系，\n那个……请、请别在意……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0483_1010_p", "source_sha256": "efa9308263deba6a5437d68a6c271fc037027cb970ef51027fc9c972e4790510", "ja": "そうか？　わかった。それにしても、\n珍しいところで会ったな。本を買いに来たのか？", "zh": "这样吗？知道了。不过话说回来，居然会在这种地方遇见你。你是来买书的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0483_1011_045kar", "source_sha256": "12af0d27b5998de6e896bc521b4cfd5e08bfce80c50f84787c450174cc17b859", "ja": "は、はい……。\n本っていうか、マンガですけど……。", "zh": "是、是的……\n与其说是书，不如说是漫画……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0483_1012_045kar", "source_sha256": "537f7abd6c58d7aa6a2aac4af52d2cff9db3db8315574108a6d3806851fd15f0", "ja": "せ、先日のお仕事が、きっかけで……。\n少女マンガを、よ、読んでみたくなって……。", "zh": "是、是因为前几天的工作……。\n我、我突然想试着读读少女漫画……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0483_1013_045kar", "source_sha256": "232b43a4686b2e60c4ff58dab4b4c8b3884d3e199cb5f9f94166d3b89e942100", "ja": "まつりさんとか、真さんとか……\nみ、みんなに、いろいろ紹介してもらったんです……♪", "zh": "像茉莉、真她们……\n给、给我介绍了好多漫画……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0483_1014_p", "source_sha256": "bce5259bfcb6b7a6c2bd36b8cfac10795d38e04ab9b724b9d6d82e849499524a", "ja": "へぇ、いいじゃないか。それじゃ今日も、\n誰かにオススメしてもらった漫画を探しにきたのか？", "zh": "哦，挺不错的嘛。那么今天也是来找别人推荐的漫画吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0483_1015_045kar", "source_sha256": "1089bc246cacc2a058f1c0b3b0b2ac555839b0869e65b89b6eb9429bd1a27f89", "ja": "は、はい……。今日は、小鳥さんが\n薦めてくれたマンガを……あっ。", "zh": "是、是的……今天是来找小鸟小姐推荐给我的漫画……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0483_1016_p", "source_sha256": "2da82b06b2528e8c49e330cca7a2368a65ad9566b9b10ce7fc6689d174993731", "ja": "？　可憐？", "zh": "？可怜？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0483_1017_045kar", "source_sha256": "6d3ae8b0cdae8ec9ad3f58b0400efe4d744ef4f59820ae232b7f180a34c5372e", "ja": "えっと……そ、その……。", "zh": "呃……那、那个……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0483_1018_p", "source_sha256": "1c560eca2ad0b4437f8d517ffe6238e8aad3b0b5d51ffa8763cdba006d6c2fa4", "ja": "音無さんが薦めてくれたなら、間違いないな！\nへえ、これか。どれどれ……。", "zh": "既然是音无小姐推荐的，那肯定没错！哦，这就是吗。让我看看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0483_1019_045kar", "source_sha256": "192477e5355ee6e8a17d898b6cb4e52aaca9c1530209e32c30a69776b6ff7448", "ja": "だっ……ダメ……！！", "zh": "不……不行……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0483_1020_p", "source_sha256": "ce5c426dd95143f2f4277844bab0f10d81caa3268ef66cd42ac3f6973cfa2810", "ja": "可憐？", "zh": "可怜？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0483_1021_045kar", "source_sha256": "ab23b557ae26e625c9ab1fcd7bf048266e1e5032ff68f0e0906dee427b008470", "ja": "あ、あの！　少女マンガなので……っ\n{$P$}さんは、見ちゃダメです……！", "zh": "啊、那个！因为是少女漫画……！\n{$P$}先生先生不可以看……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0483_1022_p", "source_sha256": "580745cb0d98b30a22c4f358080034605364214d7ce46950de7611c9365d42c3", "ja": "え？　そ、そうか。わかった……？", "zh": "诶？这、这样啊。我知道了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0483_1023_p", "source_sha256": "d1c5bf2d30df06ba5355cfc8aba6c07f5da9a0abe8534e45e3695f579cc8ad93", "ja": "（後で音無さんに聞いたら、主人公の名前が偶然にも\n『可憐』だったらしい。気恥ずかしかったのかな……）", "zh": "（后来我问了音无小姐，才知道主人公的名字碰巧也叫『可怜』。她是不是觉得有些难为情呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
